{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-267","published":"2026-10-28T17:08:55Z","modified":"2026-10-28T18:15:02.343397163Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-118546"],"details":"This module enables you to use AI on the website. It includes an AI Chatbot submodule allows you to setup a chatbot.\n\nUnder certain configurations, the chatbot does not sufficiently filter user input before rendering it, potentially allowing cross-site scripting (XSS).\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that an attacker must have access to administer blocks.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/ai","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/ai?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.4.11"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"<1.4.11"}},{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"1.5.0"},{"fixed":"1.5.2"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":">=1.5.0 <1.5.2"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"<1.4.11 || >=1.5.0 <1.5.2","source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/ai/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-267.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-267"}],"credits":[{"name":"Marcus Johansson (marcus_johansson)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/marcus_johansson"]}]}